{110}{Good day to you, sir.}{Good day to you, madam.}{}{}{}{}
{111}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{112}{Oh well, generally speaking, the island has a very mild climate. The winters tend to be cool and rainy, but it doesn't get cold enough to snow. There's two main towns on the island, one at each end, Norleigh Seahold in the north-east and Monaco on the south-west coast. It used to be heavily forested, but it's all farmland now. Oh, and ages ago it was called Kai'tan's Abode. I don't know why, but somewhere along the way, the name became Cattan.}{Oh well, generally speaking, the island has a very mild climate. The winters tend to be cool and rainy, but it doesn't get cold enough to snow. There's two main towns on the island, one at each end, Norleigh Seahold in the north-east and Monaco on the south-west coast. It used to be heavily forested, but it's all farmland now. Oh, and ages ago it was called Kai'tan's Abode. I don't know why, but somewhere along the way, the name became Cattan.}{}{}{}{ru 2231}
{113}{Kai'tan's Abode. Most interesting. If I may, a few more questions?}{}{5}{}{90}{}
{114}{Kai-tan's Adode, eh? Funny name. Me aks some more questions?}{}{-4}{}{90}{}
{115}{I thank you for your time, but I believe I should be going now.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 118}
{116}{Uhh, no. Me aks you some more questions?}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 118}
{117}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{118}{In that case, I have work to get back to and bid you good day, sir.}{In that case, I have work to get back to and bid you good day, madam.}{}{}{}{}
{119}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{120}{Norleigh? Oh, it's an ancient place, but until somewhat recently it was well-kept up and didn't show its age too much. The sea-hold was founded about 2500 years ago by a group of deserters who'd had enough of all the wars and such that Arcanum was going through. It's been built-up and fortified over the ages, and was the starting point for anyone who wanted to settle in the interior.}{Norleigh? Oh, it's an ancient place, but until somewhat recently it was well-kept up and didn't show its age too much. The sea-hold was founded about 2500 years ago by a group of deserters who'd had enough of all the wars and such that Arcanum was going through. It's been built-up and fortified over the ages, and was the starting point for anyone who wanted to settle in the interior.}{}{}{}{}
