{126}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{127}{It was an independant nation that all the central and eastern communities on the island looked to until about 200 years ago. Then King Maxwell the First of Dernholm decided that it was too risky for Cumbria to have such a powerful neighbor controlling the shipping lanes. The story goes that King Maxwell landed a modest force in the Murkweed Mire region as a ruse to draw most of Norleigh's troops away from the city, then attacked Norleigh itself. }{It was an independant nation that all the central and eastern communities on the island looked to until about 200 years ago. Then King Maxwell the First of Dernholm decided that it was too risky for Cumbria to have such a powerful neighbor controlling the shipping lanes. The story goes that King Maxwell landed a modest force in the Murkweed Mire region as a ruse to draw most of Norleigh's troops away from the city, then attacked Norleigh itself. }{}{}{}{}
{128}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{132}{}
{129}{Oh, look at the time! I really must go now. There is someone I really must meet.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 118}
{130}{Oh! Da time! Me must go now! Sumone me hafta meet. 'Bye!}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 118}
{131}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{132}{Someone inside the royal court sold them out. I'm afraid I don't remember who it was, but the Cumbrian fleet was able to sail right into the harbor without any alarm being sounded. After that, Norleigh became part of Cumbria. The town wasn't too badly damaged during the take-over and was rebuilt quickly enough. Being the main shipping port for the eastern side of the island, Norleigh did alright - at least until King Praetor took the throne.}{Someone inside the royal court sold them out. I'm afraid I don't remember who it was, but the Cumbrian fleet was able to sail right into the harbor without any alarm being sounded. After that, Norleigh became part of Cumbria. The town wasn't too badly damaged during the take-over and was rebuilt quickly enough. Being the main shipping port for the eastern side of the island, Norleigh did alright - at least until King Praetor took the throne.}{}{}{}{}
{133}{And being part of Cumbria, Norleigh's fortunes were tied to Dernholm's....}{}{5}{}{137}{}
{134}{King Praytore... I heard tings about him. Poor Nor-lay}{}{-4}{}{137}{}
{135}{Oh, look at the time! I really must go now. There is someone I really must meet.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 118}
{136}{Oh! Da time! Me must go now! Sumone me hafta meet. 'Bye!}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 118}
{137}{Indeed. Norleigh got dragged down right along with Dernholm. It's still got a few nice spots, but it's become a haven for lay-abouts, pirates, and slatterns. Almost none of the big plantations will ship their crops through Norleigh anymore. They'd rather send everything west, and from there it reaches the mainland. }{Indeed. Norleigh got dragged down right along with Dernholm. It's still got a few nice spots, but it's become a haven for lay-abouts, pirates, and slatterns. Almost none of the big plantations will ship their crops through Norleigh anymore. They'd rather send everything west, and from there it reaches the mainland. }{}{}{}{}
{138}{I see. Thank you for the history lesson. May I make another inquiry?}{}{5}{}{90}{}
{139}{Tanks fur tellin' me dis. Me aks an udder question?}{}{-4}{}{90}{}
{140}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{141}{[She thinks hard] Not that I can recall hearing about. Oh, I'm sure there's plenty of mischief in Norleigh, but once you get outside of town, it's been civilized and peaceful for as long as anyone can remember. All the monsters and such on the island have been hunted down or driven off. If any scoff-laws try to cause problems, then the men-folk band together and give 'em a good reason to want be anywhere but there. }{[She thinks hard] Not that I can recall hearing about. Oh, I'm sure there's plenty of mischief in Norleigh, but once you get outside of town, it's been civilized and peaceful for as long as anyone can remember. All the monsters and such on the island have been hunted down or driven off. If any scoff-laws try to cause problems, then the men-folk band together and give 'em a good reason to want be anywhere but there. }{}{}{}{}
