{145}{[She nods resignedly.] You heard right. He was going to Plainwicke Plantation to borrow some money from my cousin Yoki Tagemie - from my father's side; twice removed - and we haven't heard anything from him since he left. I hope he hasn't run into trouble. Or worse, got killed. Oh, dear! I do worry about him!}{[She nods resignedly.] You heard right. He was going to Plainwicke Plantation to borrow some money from my cousin Yoki Tagemie - from my father's side; twice removed - and we haven't heard anything from him since he left. I hope he hasn't run into trouble. Or worse, got killed. Oh, dear! I do worry about him!}{}{}{}{}
