{160}{Let me see your map. From Norleigh, you take the Fang Brute Road going northeast. Go past the Basilisk Roost to Dead Dog. At Dead Dog you take Old Marsh Road past the Poison Swamp until you come to a three-way fork in the Banchee Woods. Take the left fork, which is Burnowar Trail, and it will take you right to Plainwicke. And the plantation is right - here! }{Let me see your map. From Norleigh, you take the Fang Brute Road going northeast. Go past the Basilisk Roost to Dead Dog. At Dead Dog you take Old Marsh Road past the Poison Swamp until you come to a three-way fork in the Banchee Woods. Take the left fork, which is Burnowar Trail, and it will take you right to Plainwicke. And the plantation is right - here! }{}{}{}{mm 147, qu 1166 2, re +20}
